wine-fix bundles three binaries built from Wine 11.22 sources, each with a small
patch of its own (see PATCHES.md):

  winex11-xim-spot.so             from dlls/winex11.drv
  imm32-no-ime-ui-window.dll      from dlls/imm32
  explorer-systray-foreground.exe from programs/explorer

Wine is distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or
later. The patched sources stay under the same license, so the binaries, the
patch files and the build script in this package are licensed under
LGPL-2.1-or-later. The full license text is at

  https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/lgpl-2.1.txt

The wrapper scripts (wine-fix-run, wine-fix-status, wine-fix-common.sh) are
covered by the same terms.
